{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16469","headline":"重阳日寄上饶李明府 · 刘商","name":"重阳日寄上饶李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重阳秋雁未衔芦，始觉他乡节候殊。\n旅馆但知闻蟋蟀，邮童不解献茱萸。\n陶潜何处登高醉，倦客停桡一事无。\n来岁公田多种黍，莫敎黄菊笑杨朱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}